cookbook/decisions/start-multi-gpu-qualification-with-two-ranks.md:4:description: "Qualify on two RTX 5090/RTX PRO 6000 GPUs before four; keep the pod running after bounded runs at the owner’s request; host history lives in ops. Owner 2026-09-29: eight RTX PRO 6000 likely for the main run, two ranks for diagnosis and building; the Isaiah-divided 8-rank config (32 envs/rank, spm 2) is CPU-tested and its 8-GPU qualification (Task 6.3b, owner-approved pod) is open. Isaiah's only 8-GPU config (scaling_50m) keeps 256 envs/rank; his 6M multi-GPU precedent divides. winner_ce_6m is not an Isaiah-aligned fallback: its full recipe is an owner reward-design decision and its batch shape alone a measured recipe deviation."
