cookbook/references/kaggriculture-configs-follow-isaiahs-scaling-6m-recipe.md:4:description: "Task 3.4 configs deliberately align to Isaiah: 2-rank 128 envs/spm 8, 4-rank 64/spm 4 and 8-rank 32/spm 2 keep scaling_6m's global batch, 16 optimizer steps and 16,384 env steps per iteration, with its optimizer, PPO, teacher and compile settings; the configs load through the real FullConfig with a typed KaggricultureEnvConfig, and run_ppo startup checks every forward against the model's GEMM chunking before allocation, prints bounded headroom, then stops explicitly because no Kaggriculture env is wired yet. The configs are CPU-tested only; GPU chunk counts were timed separately with a teacher proxy, without a correctness check."
